r=add(124,'Morotpuré (Carrot Soup with Egg-Cream Finish)',6,65,'Carrots browned in butter are sieved into stock, thickened with a light roux and finished with cream and egg yolks.',[carrot(500),butter(60),stock(2000),flour(40),salt(),cayenne(),yolks(2),cream(100),bread(120)],['Dice {{carrot}}. Melt {{butter|0.5}} in a saucepan and brown the carrots lightly for 8–10 minutes.','Add {{stock|0.5}}, cover and simmer for 25–35 minutes until very soft. Press the carrots and liquid through a sieve into a bowl.','Melt {{butter|0.5}} in the saucepan, stir in {{flour}} and cook for 2 minutes. Gradually whisk in the carrot mixture and {{stock|0.5}}. Season with {{salt}} and {{cayenne}} and simmer for 5 minutes.']+eggfinish()+['Toast {{bread}} until crisp and serve with the soup.'],'Recipe 266 was checked against the original Swedish text. Two yolks are selected from the source range. A modern toast amount and controlled egg heating are supplied.','Soups')
